      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;From durable market totes to cross-body boho bags, there&apos;s a purse for every occasion. After mastering basic macram&amp;#xE9; techniques, discover how to add special details, such as wooden handles, metal buckles, and zippers, to elevate the style and function of your designs. With its assortment of small-scale projects, this book is great for beginners, but also provides fresh inspiration for veteran macram&amp;#xE9; enthusiasts looking to create wearable art&quot;--</marc:subfield>
